<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat again does not trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat again does not trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>No trades took place in wheat on the Sydney Futures Exchange on Friday for the second day in succession.</p>
<p>There were very few inquiries and the past week had been one of the quietest on record, Alan Harris of Elders Risk Management Pty Ltd said.</p>
<p>The market was between seasons, he said.</p>
<p>A turnaround in the market had occurred with 1997 contracts now dearer than 1998 contracts, he noted.</p>
